'''Dragon Aquarium''' (海龍館, ''Kairyūkan'', '''Sea Dragon Palace''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 13.4 Update|Version 13.4]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Unit Speed UP (M): Cats' movement speed increases by 15%.

==Requirement==
{{Combos
|{{CatCombo|Dragon Aquarium|Unit Speed Up (M)|Sea Serpent Daliasan|Li'l Fish Cat|jpname=海龍館}}
}}

==Trivia==
*This [[Cat Combo|Combo]]'s Japanese name, Kairyūkan (海龍館, "Sea Dragon Palace") may be a reference to the [[wikipedia:Dragon Palace|Dragon Palace]] (竜宮), the undersea palace of [[wikipedia:Ryūjin|Ryūjin]] in Japanese mythology and folktales such as the tale of [[wikipedia:Urashima Tarō|Urashima Tarō]]. However, the kanji used for "palace" in the Combo's name is 館 rather than 宮.

